<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brasmotor Group started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brasmotor Group started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment analyst Daniela Bretthauer started coverage of Brazilian white goods maker Brasmotor Group Thursday.</p>
<p>-- She rated Brasmotor SA and Embraco SA both strong buys. She rated Multibras SA a buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Bretthauer set a 12- to 18-month price target of 387 reais per 1,000 shares for Brasmotor, implying a 73 percent rise from current levels. She set a price target of 774 reais for Embraco, implying a 72 rise.</p>
<p>-- She estimated a 12- to 18-month target of 1,638 per 1,000 shares for Multibras, implying a 64 percent increase.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
